 **********************************************
 ********* Roland GP-16 Patch Chart ***********
 **********************************************
 
 Patch Name: Acoustic
     Author: Jonas Nordin
   Comments: Made for steel-stringed acoustic guitars
 
 PROGRAM CHANGE NO. B: 28
 
 SEQUENCE BLOCK A	123456
 SEQUENCE BLOCK B	123456
 
 BLOCK A - ON/OFF       1***56
 BLOCK B - ON/OFF       *2**56
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-1 COMPRESSOR
 
    TONE 0
  ATTACK 20
 SUSTAIN 80
   LEVEL 40
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-5 PARAMETRIC EQ
 
    HI FREQ 8.00 kHz
   HI LEVEL +11.0 dB
 
   H.M.FREQ 2.98 kHz
     H.M. Q 1.0
 H.M. LEVEL +0.5 dB
 
  L.M. FREQ 535 Hz
     L.M. Q 1.0
 L.M. LEVEL +3.5 dB
 
    LO FREQ 250 Hz
   LO LEVEL +1.5 dB
 
  OUT LEVEL +5.5 dB
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-6 NOISE SUPPRESSOR
 
    SENS 32
 RELEASE 0
   LEVEL 100
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-2 
        d. SPACE-D
 MODE 1
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-5 REVERB
 
 DECAY 1.0 sec
 
 MODE: ROOM 1
 
    CUTOFF THRU
 PRE DELAY 49 msec
  E. LEVEL 38
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-6 LINEOUT FILTER
 
 PRESENCE 10
   TREBLE 50
   MIDDLE 82
     BASS 78
 
 ----------------------------------
 MASTER VOLUME 75
 
 ----------------------------------
 EXPRESSION PEDAL
 
 ASSIGN OFF
 
 ----------------------------------
 OUTPUT SELECT
 
 CHANNEL  1
